# >>> BODY envelope fix round 1: the T3 cape (D57) >>>
# The people's cape at T3 (D57, STYLE_P2 29.3; envelope fix round 1, BODY tools/capet3.py): to the coat's hem, facing D its
# edges 1-2 px beside the pauldrons and the arms, never beside the legs; facing R / L it falls back from the shoulders
# to 1-2 columns behind the head at the hip. `!walk` keeps the walk on its own drape (the side walk's kick is P2b's).
